<title>LITHUANIA: MEDIENOS PLAUSHAS APRIL SALES 3.4 MLN LITAS.</title>
<headline>MEDIENOS PLAUSHAS APRIL SALES 3.4 MLN LITAS.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-04-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cardboard producer Medienos Plaushas said on Tuesday that its sales in April were 3.4 million litas, a slight fall from 3.5 million litas in March.</p>
<p>But company director general Petras Chesna told Reuters that the firm expected 10 percent growth in sales during the next few month and that sales for the whole of the year would be 10 percnet higher than the 41.8 million litas in 1996.</p>
<p>The company last year also reported a net profit of 1.7 million litas.</p>
<p>Medienos is listed on the official list of the Vilnius bourse.</p>
<p>-- Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
